## Heartbeat Completion Gate

A LifeOps install is fully live only when the CoS scheduler heartbeat exists and has been verified in Codex Desktop.

- CoS scheduler automation: pending until setup creates/verifies `lifeops-scheduler`
- Operator automation: optional; pending until setup records the Operator thread id and creates/verifies `lifeops-operator`
- Codex Session Harvester automation: optional; pending until setup verifies Codex session files, records the worker thread id, and creates/verifies `lifeops-codex-session-harvester`
- Chronicle Harvester automation: optional; pending until setup verifies Chronicle access, records the worker thread id, and creates/verifies `lifeops-chronicle-harvester`

If the setup agent could not create Codex Desktop automations, treat the workspace as installed but not fully live. Keep the remaining setup step visible in [[vault/Operations/ACTION_LEDGER.md]] and run `RUN SCHEDULER` manually in the CoS thread until automation is configured.

